      "text": "LET THE POOR BREATHE !!\n\nI mean, The rich have their coins, their private groups. Their pumps and their exits.\n\nBut what about us ? \n\nThe ones trading $10 and praying for a 2x?\n\nThe ones grinding, building, onboarding friends even when our bags are down ?\n\nWe are the many !!\n\nBillions of us. Different countries. Different struggles. The same fight.\n\nFrom Lagos to Manila, Mumbai to New York, Nairobi to London , the story is the same.\n\n> We work harder.\n\n> We hustle longer.\n\n> And yet, the system keeps us running in circles.\n\nThat ends today.\n\n$POORS is The People’s Coin , The Global Underdog Movement.\n\n> No VCs.\n\n> No whale games.\n\n> No insiders holding the strings.\n\n> It's a token for the people, by the people, powered by the people.\n\n> We may be poor in fiat, but we’re rich in something they’ll never have :\n\n1. Numbers, there are billions of us.\n\n2. Creativity, memes, ideas, and culture that can’t be bought.\n\n3. Community, a movement that grows stronger every day.\n\n4. When we unite, we’re not small.\n\nWhen we move together, we’re unstoppable.\n\n> $POORS is proof that being broke isn’t a weakness it’s our superpower.\n\n> This isn’t just a token.\n\n> This is a voice. A protest. A promise that the future of crypto belongs to all of us , not just the few.\n\n> One token.\n> Billions of underdogs.\n> One unstoppable movement.\n> This is $POORS.\n> The People’s Coin.\n> The Global Underdog Movement.\n\nJoin the $POORS movement with @nexaxyz here :\n\nhttps://t.co/74OvtKNk62\n\nRemember it's SuiSZN and it's all powered by @nexaxyz",
